    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyrm Words is a deck building word puzzle rougelike. Use your words to fight fantasy creatures with unique abilities. The words you play determine the strength of your attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/14c24bad187e4c37dd768d0fe795d5a0.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=580 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/14c24bad187e4c37dd768d0fe795d5a0.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/14c24bad187e4c37dd768d0fe795d5a0.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/e32a5aefd8c4a74a95bfe34d3d5dc5f9.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=210 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/e32a5aefd8c4a74a95bfe34d3d5dc5f9.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/e32a5aefd8c4a74a95bfe34d3d5dc5f9.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a variety of unique fantasy creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/934d9774ad178a961f0f60aefaab7bd9.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=244 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/934d9774ad178a961f0f60aefaab7bd9.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/934d9774ad178a961f0f60aefaab7bd9.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new rules and a changing board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/d4db55d78f34418cfa5561a8937ef9ce.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=338 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/d4db55d78f34418cfa5561a8937ef9ce.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/d4db55d78f34418cfa5561a8937ef9ce.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot potions and cast spells to give yourself an edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment and upgrade your tiles to gain new abilities and change your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyrm Words is a deck building word puzzle rougelike. Use your words to fight fantasy creatures with unique abilities. The words you play determine the strength of your attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/14c24bad187e4c37dd768d0fe795d5a0.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=580 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/14c24bad187e4c37dd768d0fe795d5a0.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/14c24bad187e4c37dd768d0fe795d5a0.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/e32a5aefd8c4a74a95bfe34d3d5dc5f9.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=210 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/e32a5aefd8c4a74a95bfe34d3d5dc5f9.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/e32a5aefd8c4a74a95bfe34d3d5dc5f9.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a variety of unique fantasy creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/934d9774ad178a961f0f60aefaab7bd9.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=244 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/934d9774ad178a961f0f60aefaab7bd9.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/934d9774ad178a961f0f60aefaab7bd9.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new rules and a changing board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/d4db55d78f34418cfa5561a8937ef9ce.poster.avif?t=1743437815\" width=338 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/d4db55d78f34418cfa5561a8937ef9ce.webm?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350960/extras/d4db55d78f34418cfa5561a8937ef9ce.mp4?t=1743437815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot potions and cast spells to give yourself an edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment and upgrade your tiles to gain new abilities and change your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
